From: folia-linear-ci <folia-linear-ci@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 19:44:44 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Linear age-based flush + first-dirty ordering
 (minecraft-0017)

Loop-3 (agent 25): wire flush-frequency to a REAL age-based flush +
switch markDirty to FIRST-dirty ordering (LinkedHashMap, no reorder on
repeat marks). DELIBERATE behavior change (only one in the set):
MAX_DIRTY victim changes least-recently-written -> longest-unflushed;
strictly more correct, ship unconditionally.

Age: flushDirty flushes only files with first-dirty age >= frequency
seconds; evict forces all (unload must not lose young writes); pressure
flush ignores age (bounds memory). Frequency from GlobalConfiguration
(default 10s), test overrides for immediate flush.

