@@ -214,15 +255,25 @@ public final class LinearFlushCoordinator {
      * Records a file with unflushed writes. Over-capacity evicts the eldest
      * entry with an inline flush (backpressure on the caller, i.e. a Moonrise
      * I/O thread), so write bursts cannot grow memory without bound.
+     *
+     * <p>Linear - minecraft-0017: FIRST-dirty ordering (no reorder on repeat
